flowchart TB
    accTitle: Managed append from PostgreSQL commit to a proven Iceberg receipt
    accDescr: Ordinary bound captures feed the scoped fixture. Native worker integration remains open. Independent providers authorize one send per attempt and reconcile an unknown result using a read-only lookup. Insufficient evidence holds the claim.
    local["Working SQL path<br/>Staged INSERT → local PostgreSQL commit"]:::code
    legacy["Active legacy worker<br/>Publishes unbound segments<br/>Happy-path smoke"]:::tested
    bind["Bound SQL capture<br/>Enrolled table, ref and grant generation"]:::tested
    claim["Ledger provider · 1.4<br/>Claim exact committed members + digest"]:::code
    prep["Writer + catalog providers<br/>Prepare immutable objects and exact request"]:::code
    fence["Ledger provider · 1.5 / 1.6<br/>Authorize once, retain bytes, flush intent WAL"]:::code
    send["Scoped recovery fixture<br/>Dispatch authorized request once"]:::tested
    worker["Open deployment gate<br/>Native worker and credential resolution"]:::gate
    proof["Recovery provider after reply loss<br/>Read-only lookup of original proposal"]:::code
    done["Positive proof<br/>Finalize exact members at introducing snapshot"]:::code
    hold["Inconclusive<br/>Reserve claim and retry lookup only"]:::code
    local --> legacy
    local --> bind
    bind --> claim
    claim --> prep --> fence
    fence --> send
    fence -.-> worker
    send --> proof
    proof --> done
    proof --> hold
    classDef code fill:#e5eff7,stroke:#365c78,color:#102f46
    classDef tested fill:#e0f3e9,stroke:#246b50,color:#164332
    classDef gate fill:#fff2d7,stroke:#906221,color:#51370f,stroke-dasharray:5 3
